Fire a shot at the target tile that blinds enemies for [2, 2, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5)] turns, marks them for 2 turns and illuminates the area within radius 2 for [4, 5, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] turns. Enemies within the illuminated area lose [22, 29, 34, 38, 42 (TL1-5; DEX 100)] defence and stealth power and cannot benefit from concealment.

The status chance increases with your Accuracy, and the defense reduction with your Dexterity.
